{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cruel and simple movement clicker game. Starting with a 1-in-4 chance to move as planned, can you collect the Coin of Rehtaeh and escape in 10 steps? Rage, upgrade, persevere, and discover multiple endings. A child cried in frustration during playtesting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random chance rules this game. You have<strong> but a chance</strong>\u00a0to move the direction you choose. You<i> may</i>\u00a0beat the game in exactly 10 moves, but he the odds are<i> 1 in 1,048,576.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain XP with successful moves to level up and turn the odds to your favor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Persevere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting 10 steps is never guaranteed, but persevere to discover multiple endings, new characters, and unique procedural generation. The real sickos can reset to unlock boons, even more characters, and even more endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple directional movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige Shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Unlocks</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4112820?t=1761759425","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4112820?t=1761759425","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112820/f336256676e51256f667b1db4a3e4d2c5348e8d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761759425","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112820/f336256676e51256f667b1db4a3e4d2c5348e8d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761759425","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"